{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/e0b2b6bceb9fc11fcdb70ee0a79313af.poster.avif?t=1770061582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/e0b2b6bceb9fc11fcdb70ee0a79313af.webm?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/e0b2b6bceb9fc11fcdb70ee0a79313af.mp4?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as <strong>Dahlia</strong>, awakened from an endless sleep with no memories and <strong>Axo</strong>, an unlikely flying companion bound to her fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they descend into a fallen civilization consumed by the <strong>Crystal Plague</strong>, exploring ancient lands, surviving lethal traps, and fighting creatures twisted beyond recognition. Every step forward reveals fragments of a past that was buried for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover who Dahlia truly is! And decide whether this broken world deserves to be rewritten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why play this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a vast, beautiful world and solve the mysteries of three different races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> a formidable collection of foes and bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> for every challenge with powerful new skills and abilities for Dahlia and Axo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/126022a935acb780da0deac42ca118bd.poster.avif?t=1770061582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/126022a935acb780da0deac42ca118bd.webm?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/126022a935acb780da0deac42ca118bd.mp4?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/f6326c337a4768eecd5f02b272fd43d2.avif?t=1770061582\" width=276 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world shaped by loss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, hand-crafted world once ruled by <strong>three distinct races</strong>, each with its own beliefs, culture, and downfall.<br>Their lands now decay in different ways - silent cities, infected sanctuaries, forgotten machines still humming with purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plague didn\u2019t just kill them.<br>It <strong>changed</strong> them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do the corrupted attack Dahlia and Axo on sight?<br>And what does her awakening have to do with the kingdom\u2019s collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/2dfa70a7c2c4a4da6572613f16873196.poster.avif?t=1770061582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/2dfa70a7c2c4a4da6572613f16873196.webm?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/2dfa70a7c2c4a4da6572613f16873196.mp4?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/4774b022bcfc03b3ed8baad335bbb121.avif?t=1770061582\" width=171 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat that rewards mastery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a wide array of enemies and bosses. From swift predators to towering monstrosities born of crystal and memory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is <strong>precise and deliberate</strong>, built around timing, positioning, and pattern recognition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area introduces <strong>new enemy behaviors</strong> and combat challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss</strong> fights test both reflexes and understanding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t about strength alone, it\u2019s about learning the rules of a world that no longer follows them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/35d9cd775ef8065d859be70b6149d43a.poster.avif?t=1770061582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/35d9cd775ef8065d859be70b6149d43a.webm?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/35d9cd775ef8065d859be70b6149d43a.mp4?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/c688669b34fc15320c0819b9a58f1f9e.avif?t=1770061582\" width=276 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow, Adapt, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, craft, and unlock powerful <strong>runes and abilities</strong> for both Dahlia and Axo.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle with new movement and combat skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergize Dahlia\u2019s powers with Axo\u2019s unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build to overcome different enemies and environments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade changes how you move, fight, and explore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/58df44b9ba5ac876cdb83ebb72467ee3.poster.avif?t=1770061582\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/58df44b9ba5ac876cdb83ebb72467ee3.webm?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284650/extras/58df44b9ba5ac876cdb83ebb72467ee3.mp4?t=1770061582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN THE JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo.<br>Share your feedback.<br>Help shape the future of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community 